DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nBehavioural Science and the science of happiness \nSy
	nopsis\n:\nWe will briefly review two major schools of thought in the scie
	nce of happiness: (1) Hedonic & (2) Eudaimonic well-being. Then\, we'll di
	scuss the implications of these views for us\, the DBS community\, and how
	 we can empower ourselves to "live fulfilled" at DBS.\nSpeaker\n:\nJung Ky
	un KIM\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first
	 time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex 
	Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/perso
	nal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=Sz
	BDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from 
	DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of th
	e event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com
	/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=ebba34ae8cf4954e99a3843031f5d5b75> \n2.	Enter your
	 First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoi
	n via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store o
	r Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2515 914
	 8254\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +
	65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22
	-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeet
	ing Number:  2515 914 8254\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/
	dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e1be1d7fb8cf19dadf242f64798d49372> \n \n \n \n \
	n \n
